<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Posázavská stezka: Petrov–Kamenný Přívoz — Petrov u Prahy–Kamenný Přívoz</name><desc>Start at Petrov u Prahy railway station, cross the footbridge to Pikovice and follow the Posázavská stezka above the Sázava through its river viewpoints to Kamenný Přívoz railway station. This route stays on the walking trail; the optional ferry and viaduct excursion are separate.

